msgid ""
"This lesson teaches you how to run simulations with multiple replicas. You "
"do not need to know how to run simulations with multiple replicas to "
"complete the exercises on optimising the performance of PLUMED. You may like"
" to consult this lesson, however, as it shows you how to install PLUMED and "
"gromacs with MPI. You will need parallel versions of these two codes to "
"complete the exercises in this lesson."
msgstr ""

